<!doctype html>
<!-- 404 fallback page. Static bilingual copy; most hosts serve this file for
     unknown routes automatically (Netlify, Vercel, GitHub Pages, nginx config). -->
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
		<title>404 — CloudLocal</title>
		<style>
			* { margin: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
			body {
				min-height: 100vh; display: grid; place-items: center; text-align: center;
				background: #f5f0eb; color: #1a1f2b; padding: 2rem;
				font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
			}
			.glow {
				position: fixed; width: 480px; height: 480px; border-radius: 50%;
				background: radial-gradient(closest-side, rgba(94, 234, 212, .4), transparent 70%);
				pointer-events: none;
			}
			.glow.a { left: -160px; top: -140px; }
			.glow.b { right: -140px; bottom: -160px; }
			.badge {
				display: inline-block; font: 600 .72rem 'SF Mono', 'Cascadia Code', monospace;
				letter-spacing: .12em; color: #0d9488; background: rgba(20, 184, 166, .12);
				border: 1px solid rgba(13, 148, 136, .3); border-radius: 20px; padding: .3rem .8rem;
			}
			h1 { margin-top: 1.4rem; font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 6vw, 4rem); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.035em; }
			h1 em { font-style: normal; color: #0d9488; }
			p { margin-top: 1rem; color: #5c6674; font-size: .95rem; max-width: 42ch; margin-inline: auto; line-height: 1.6; }
			.actions { margin-top: 2.2rem; display: flex; gap: .8rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
			.btn {
				display: inline-block; text-decoration: none; font: 600 .82rem 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
				padding: .68rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px; transition: transform 150ms ease, box-shadow 150ms ease;
			}
			.btn-primary { background: #0d9488; color: #fff; }
			.btn-primary:hover { background: #14b8a6; transform: translateY(-1px); box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(13, 148, 136, .25); }
			.btn-ghost { color: #5c6674; border: 1px solid #ddd6cd; background: #fdfbf6; }
			.btn-ghost:hover { color: #1a1f2b; }
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<span class="glow a"></span>
		<span class="glow b"></span>
		<main>
			<span class="badge">404</span>
			<h1>This page took <em>a different route</em>.</h1>
			<p lang="es">La página que buscas no existe o cambió de dirección. | The page you are looking for does not exist or has moved.</p>
			<div class="actions">
				<a class="btn btn-primary" href="/">← CloudLocal</a>
				<a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://github.com/AlexisVarela2811/CloudLocal">GitHub ↗</a>
			</div>
		</main>
	</body>
</html>
